abstract: "ClassicalGuitarOntology v1.0.5 is an OWL ontology for representing curriculum-derived knowledge in Level 1 classical guitar education. It models learning objectives, teaching practices, technical skills, exercises, studies, repertoire-related material, assessment criteria, posture-related concepts, guitar-part knowledge, level membership, and their semantic relations. This release provides the underlying ontology version referenced in a qualitative study of teachers’ perceptions of a teacher-facing representation of the framework; that study did not constitute technical validation of the OWL artifact."
